#. Add-on description
#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information from add-ons manager
#: buildVars.py:26
msgid ""
"Set of tools to manage add-ons not available on NVDA add-ons store:\n"
"\t* Add-on packager: To create a add-on backup file or to send a modified "
"add-on to someone test or use;\n"
"\t* Multiple installer: Allows to select add-ons from a folder and install "
"all at once;\n"
"\t* Make/restore Backups: Allow to backup and restore some NVDA preferences, "
"such as configurations, profiles and dictionaries;\n"
"\t* Add-ons documentation: allow to open the documentation file.\n"
"\t"
